  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/nixie-dev/nixie/zipball/2025.02-a2",
  "body": "This marks the beginning of Nixie's \"next-gen\" design, incorporating two big changes:\r\n\r\n- #15 completely changed the way static Nix binaries are produced, especially on macOS. Now all versions of Nix are exactly in sync using the flake's `nix` input.\r\n- #16 is a complete rewrite of the final product, the wrapper script, using [Amber](https://github.com/amber-lang/amber)! This should make it much easier to add and test new features."
