  "body": "Nixie now officially supports macOS, which means the generated `./nix` script can now be considered feature-complete.\r\n\r\nThere are still a few things (#4) I want to do before I'm ready to call it a _bona fide_ release, but let that not deter early adopters of Nixie, for you can still run a quick `nixie update` afterwards."
